Z||000034||Rodrv6||12-22-2001||10:16 AM||||Projects over the winter:<BR>Finish getting pilot's license<BR>Get the fuselage skins installed on my homebuilt airplane<BR>Do a totall dissassembly and rebuild on my 88 GT. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Car needs repaint, seat upholstery, dew wipes, windshield, headliner, quarter windows, and a whole host of other little things.  (and I really enjoy the prospect of another complete rebuild.  The satisfaction after being able to take a bare space frame and roll it up on it's side and pressure wash the daylights out of it so that it's as clean as the day Pontiac built it is tremendous <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<BR>Boredom will not be an issue!!!!!!!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  <BR>White 88 GT :)||||reg||7
